    "description": "<p>When you acquire this Skill, choose a Species other than <strong>humanoid</strong>.</p><p>Once per Scene, you may create a <strong>Bond</strong> of <strong>inferiority</strong> or <strong>admiration</strong> with a creature of that Species, as long as you are aware of their presence or a sign of their passing. As long as you have this Bond, that creature is your Quarry. If you fail to form a Bond, your expertise has revealed that the Species is not present/involved.</p><p>You gain a bonus of <strong>【SL】 </strong>to Checks you perform to locate, track, or <strong>Study</strong> your Quarry.</p>",
